[01:31.24] I was only seventeen
[01:33.46] I fell in love with a gypsy queen
[01:36.46] She told me - hold on!
[01:45.66] Her father was the leading man
[01:47.66] Said "You're not welcome on our land"
[01:52.14] And then as a foe, he told me to go
[02:04.48] He took me to a little shack
[02:07.56] And put a whip across my back
[02:10.68] Then told her - leave me
[02:19.48] I was out for quite a time
[02:21.80] Came back with her on my mind
[02:25.64] Sweet little girl - she means all the world
[02:33.16] Though I want my gypsy queen
[02:45.92] Will she still be torn between
[02:47.98] Her father and lover?
[02:51.46] One day I will go to him
[05:47.32] Strong enough to fight and win
[05:50.58] The kind of a man that he'll understand
